                                "example_id": "93797266-93fd-414d-a708-f57d2630303e",
                                "sense_id": "0bb62791-a7f8-3d31-838b-41b849441fa5",
                                "text": "‘King and kingdom,’ concurred d'Aguesseau, wisest of wise eighteenth-century legists, ‘form a single entity.’"
